darktable
---------
Luxe embeds and links against darktable's core image-processing engine
(the "pixelpipe") in-process via a GDExtension.

  Project: https://www.darktable.org
  Source:  https://github.com/darktable-org/darktable
  License: GNU General Public License v3.0 (GPL-3.0)

darktable is free software: you can redistribute it and/or modify it under
the terms of the GNU General Public License as published by the Free Software
Foundation, either version 3 of the License, or (at your option) any later
version.

The darktable build shipped in this distribution is built from commit
6a2f19f4e3ba834ada20de9b5e63ab13933d8871 (nightly-40-g6a2f19f4e3,
2026-09-15), configured with `-DUSE_GUI=OFF -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=RelWithDebInfo`
(no source modifications). See README.md's "Building darktable" section for
the exact build steps; update this pointer whenever the shipped build is
rebuilt against a different darktable checkout.

godot-cpp
---------
The GDExtension shim (extension/) is built against godot-cpp, Godot's official
C++ bindings, which provide the bridge between the C++ backend and the Godot
engine.

  Project: https://github.com/godotengine/godot-cpp
  License: MIT License

godot-cpp is distributed under the MIT License and is not covered by Luxe's
GPL-3.0 licensing.

Godot Engine
------------
